  "edge_schema": "mailvora_edge_pat",
  "prompt": "For each signup month of 2025 (signup_ts, in UTC), how many users were activated within 7 days and then paid within 30 days, and what were the step rates? A user is activated in time when the first first_campaign_sent event came at most 7 days (168 hours) after signup_ts, and paid in time when the user was activated in time and the first payment (paid_at, refunded or not) came at or after that activation and at most 30 days after it. All times are UTC instants. Return six columns, in this order: signup_month (the first day of the month), signed_up, activated_in_7_days, paid_in_30_days (each a number of users), activation_rate (activated_in_7_days over signed_up) and paid_step_rate (paid_in_30_days over activated_in_7_days), each rate a fraction between 0 and 1; paid_step_rate is missing for a month with no user activated in time. Return one row for each signup month. Any row order is fine.",
